{"title":"Supreme Cursemancer","synopsis":"Ye Lin transmigrated into a world overrun by demons and monsters. On the day of his class transfer, he became an SSS-rank Forbidden Spellcaster—and was immediately met with ridicule. Why? Because casting forbidden spells costs lifespan, and most Forbidden Spellcasters die young. But only Ye Lin knows: with his immortal body, the profession’s fatal flaw means nothing to him. When Ye Lin casually unleashed hundreds of forbidden spells in a single move, everyone around him was terrified. “How many lives do you have?!” “You’re using forbidden spells like normal attacks?!”","alternative_title":"I ! I'm the strongest forbidden spellcaster in history, Eu! O Conjurador de Magias Proibidas Mais Forte da História","author":"吃掉小杏仁","artist":"吃掉小杏仁","genres":["Action","Adventure","Fantasy","Isekai"],"chapters":[{"id":"30c6aa92-5af5-40fd-8ea0-12826fe480ea","number":"75","title":"Chapter 75","date":"2026-07-22","images":[]},{"id":"baa832de-997b-47e9-83ce-0a58d1970de8","number":"74","title":"Chapter 74","date":"2026-07-15","images":[]},{"id":"592e5f7e-8d2b-49a1-bbfb-c0612a1c02f6","number":"73","title":"Chapter 73","date":"2026-07-10","images":[]},{"id":"6e2f2fe1-8145-4f7b-be3f-07204d8db564","number":"72","title":"Chapter 72","date":"2026-07-10","images":[]},{"id":"5c0376e8-6374-49e6-b2e0-28e5858b76e8","number":"71","title":"Chapter 71","date":"2026-06-21","images":[]},{"id":"80dad82a-8fbb-454d-af11-fc3b9638cb5e","number":"70","title":"Chapter 70","date":"2026-06-19","images":[]},{"id":"8af0e061-66d7-4211-8d37-04c03ff517d7","number":"69","title":"Chapter 69","date":"2026-06-19","images":[]},{"id":"bf7a1b4a-920f-4f25-9bef-393a799e0ec1","number":"68","title":"Chapter 68","date":"2026-06-18","images":[]},{"id":"3fab5505-4f92-416b-9d6f-7c7d7bfc2000","number":"67","title":"Chapter 67","date":"2026-06-18","images":[]},{"id":"b1e153b2-f5c4-4f2f-a188-d09a600113e2","number":"66","title":"Chapter 66","date":"2026-06-16","images":[]},{"id":"be69e2ee-